<title>PAKISTAN: BOC Pakistan first half net up 28 pct.</title>
<headline>BOC Pakistan first half net up 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31, 1997 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales			443 vs 395</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	147 vs 125</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	  98 vs  76</p>
<p>    Interim dividend    15 pct vs  15 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is BOC Pakistan Ltd, formerly Pakistan Oxygen Ltd. Book closure May 29 to June 4. Ex-dividend date May 29.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
